[{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0010","text":"好────\n今天就到这里吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0020","text":"嗯……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0030","text":"练习室的门────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0040","text":"哒哒哒哒────────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0050","text":"────────────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0060","text":"又一声不吭地自己来用了啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0070","text":"至少跟我说一声的话我会很高兴的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0080","text":"────────────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0090","text":"而且\n今天不是说了希望你休息吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0100","text":"吵死了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0110","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0120","text":"我水平太差\n没时间了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0130","text":"赶不上了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0140","text":"但是\n练过头的话……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0150","text":"上了舞台────────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0160","text":"谁会来帮我吗────────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0170","text":"路加……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0180","text":"明白了吧\n你能做的事什么都没有"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0190","text":"靠自己的力量想办法……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0200","text":"回去────────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0210","text":"不……果然不行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0220","text":"啊……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0230","text":"路加已经好几天没休息了\n过度训练反而会适得其反"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0240","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0250","text":"肌肉积累疲劳的话\n表现力也会下降……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0260","text":"严重的话\n身体搞坏也是有可能的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0270","text":"你要说多少次"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0280","text":"跟你没关系"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0290","text":"……不"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0300","text":"有关系"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0310","text":"啊……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0320","text":"我也有必须要守护的……\n重要的偶像───"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0330","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0340","text":"所以\n希望你能爱惜身体"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0350","text":"吵死了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0351","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0360","text":"路加，你要去哪？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0370","text":"回去了……！\n有只烦人的苍蝇在，根本没法练习"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0380","text":"（接上句）有只烦人的苍蝇在，根本没法练习"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0390","text":"这算什么啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_26000000_02_0400","text":"路加……"}]
